# UI walk covers new features

A user-facing phone feature is not done until both UI walks run it.

## Required

- Add the proof to the Android test class `UiWalkSuite` already runs, and to the iOS class named in `ports/scripts/run-ui-walk.sh`.
- Add one row to `WALK_FEATURES` in `ports/tests/test_agile.py`: feature name, Android proof, iOS proof.
- Put that feature name in `ports/tests/UI-WALK.md`.
- A new `*Test.kt` or `*Tests.swift` must be named by the walk. Do not add it to `WALK_EXEMPT`. That set is only the older native and compat checks.
- Run `ports/scripts/run-ui-walk.sh` on this Mac before calling the feature done. GitHub Actions does not boot an emulator.

## Leave alone

- Do not tap Panic wipe or Check for updates.
- Do not put the emulator walk back on GitHub Actions.
- Regressive status strings in the 10-phase session stay.
